{{main|2026 AFA World Cup}}

The '''third matchday of the 2026 AFA World Cup''' was played on 18 June 2026 and produced 18 goals. [[Volisania national football team|Volisania]]'s 5–0 win over [[Kalisongo national football team|Kalisongo]] was the day's most lopsided result, while [[Sanyan national football team|Sanyan]]'s 4–2 victory over [[Okaiken national football team|Okaiken]] was the highest-scoring match. [[Dagit national football team|Dagit]] continued their strong start with a 2–0 win over [[Ayorin national football team|Ayorin]], and [[Balisca national football team|Balisca]] and [[Sanrobonia national football team|Sanrobonia]] were both held to 1–1 draws.

