=== Matchday summary ===

The third matchday produced a blend of routine wins and late drama. [[Volisania national football team|Volisania]] maintained their perfect start with a five-goal rout of [[Kalisongo national football team|Kalisongo]], while [[Sanyan national football team|Sanyan]]'s attacking burst against [[Okaiken national football team|Okaiken]] delivered the highest-scoring match of the day. [[Dagit national football team|Dagit]] added another clean-sheet victory, [[Balisca national football team|Balisca]] and [[Sanrobonia national football team|Sanrobonia]] were both forced to settle for draws, and [[Nakamizu national football team|Nakamizu]] snatched a late equaliser against [[Balboa national football team|Balboa]].

